#: src/manpages.rs:205
msgid "HOW IT WORKS"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: src/manpages.rs:208
msgid ""
"The daemon reads key presses from /dev/input and keeps the last 64 typed characters in memory. When they end with a snippet's trigger, it erases the trigger with Backspace through a uinput virtual keyboard and pastes the expansion, restoring the clipboard afterwards. Snippets with {arg:NAME} parameters open the picker's form instead."
msgstr ""
"守护进程从 /dev/input 读取按键，并在内存中保留最近键入的 64 个字符。当这些字符以某个片段的触发词结尾时，它通过 uinput 虚拟键盘用退格键删除触发词，粘贴展开后的内容，然后恢复剪贴板。带有 {arg:NAME} 参数的片段则会改为打开选择器的表单。"

#: src/manpages.rs:214
msgid ""
"Setup installs a udev rule that tags keyboards and /dev/uinput with uaccess, the way desktops grant devices to the person at the computer, and applies it at once: no group to join and no need to log out. The daemon starts and stops typed triggers as they are turned on and off, and picks up keyboards plugged in later."
msgstr ""
"设置过程会安装一条 udev 规则，用 uaccess 标记键盘和 /dev/uinput（桌面环境就是这样把设备授权给坐在电脑前的用户的），并立即应用：无需加入任何用户组，也无需注销。守护进程会在键入触发词开启和关闭时相应地启动和停止它，并会识别之后插入的键盘。"

#: src/manpages.rs:220
msgid ""
"Keys are decoded with a US layout, so triggers made of letters, digits and ; work on most layouts while punctuation may differ. A trigger that is a prefix of another (;d and ;date) fires first, so the longer one is unreachable."
msgstr ""
"按键按美式键盘布局解码，因此由字母、数字和 ; 组成的触发词在大多数布局下都能使用，而标点可能不同。如果一个触发词是另一个的前缀（;d 和 ;date），前者会先触发，导致较长的那个无法触发。"

#: src/manpages.rs:227
msgid "SECURITY"
msgstr "安全"

#: src/manpages.rs:229
msgid ""
"Keyboard access applies to every program the person at the computer runs, not only Voltkit. Typed text is never logged, written to disk or sent anywhere. `voltkit expander remove-access` (or turning typed triggers off in the app and choosing to remove access) deletes /etc/udev/rules.d/70-voltkit-typed-triggers.rules and /etc/modules-load.d/voltkit-uinput.conf; the access already granted ends at the next restart. Setups from before version 0.6 also added you to the input group, which `gpasswd -d $USER input` undoes."
msgstr ""
"键盘访问权限适用于坐在电脑前的用户运行的所有程序，而不仅仅是 Voltkit。键入的文字绝不会被记录、写入磁盘或发送到任何地方。`voltkit expander remove-access`（或在应用中关闭键入触发词并选择移除访问权限）会删除 /etc/udev/rules.d/70-voltkit-typed-triggers.rules 和 /etc/modules-load.d/voltkit-uinput.conf；已授予的访问权限会在下次重启时结束。0.6 版之前的设置还会把你加入 input 组，可用 `gpasswd -d $USER input` 撤销。"

